<title>UK: Grain carrier puts in to Spain with engine damage.</title>
<headline>Grain carrier puts in to Spain with engine damage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Maltese-flag bulk carrier Mirsini, loaded with grain for Iraq, has arrived in Ferrol, Spain, with engine damage, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 26,416 dwt bulker had sailed from Montoire, France.</p>
</text>
